  "about": {
    "title": "About the Dark Explorers set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Dark Explorers is a Black & White expansion released on 9 May 2012. It has 111 cards: 108 in the main set and 3 secret rares. There are also 96 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 108 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (204 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 207 cards, adding the 3 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
